# Only docker-assets/, docker-build/, and Dockerfile are ever COPYed into an
# image (see the Dockerfile's COPY instructions) - everything else here just
# bloats the build context sent to the daemon on every single build without
# affecting layer cache validity, since Docker's cache keys are already
# scoped to exactly the COPYed paths.
.git
.github
.vscode
my.local.notes
tmp
docs
runner-images-src
tools
README.md
README.FR.md
LICENSE
compose*.yml
.env*
.gitignore
.gitmodules
